# Patterns to ignore when loading/packaging the nico-prereqs chart (chart: ".").
# Keep non-chart artifacts out of helm - notably the doca-platform and nv-rms
# git submodules setup.sh installs from, whose large .git pack files otherwise
# exceed helm's per-file size limit. .dpf-src/ and .rms-src/ are the clone
# caches older setup.sh versions left behind.
.dpf-src/
.rms-src/
doca-platform/
nv-rms/
.git/
.gitignore
*.bak
values/*.dpf.bak
# Common editor/VCS noise
*.swp
*.tmp
.DS_Store
